semua berjalan baik.

496
00:30:06,834 --> 00:30:08,301
Kau mau hidup di sini,
kau harus mempelajarinya.

497
00:30:08,334 --> 00:30:10,155
Tapi aku tidak mau hidup di sini.
Aku hanya mau-

498
00:30:10,180 --> 00:30:11,227
Peraturan kolam nomor 1,

499
00:30:11,300 --> 00:30:12,413
jangan jadi orang asing.

500
00:30:12,524 --> 00:30:14,517
Susah kalau marah pada seseorang
kalau kau tidak tahu namanya.

501
00:30:14,619 --> 00:30:15,612
Kelihatan bagus, Ron.

502
00:30:15,751 --> 00:30:16,920
Terima kasih, Pak.

503
00:30:16,945 --> 00:30:17,720
Kau juga, Fran.

504
00:30:17,800 --> 00:30:19,300
Tom, Lequan, Rosie.

505
00:30:19,400 --> 00:30:20,688
Tamara, Prudence, Maddie.

506
00:30:20,735 --> 00:30:21,761
Pete, Peter PD.

507
00:30:21,786 --> 00:30:23,608
Shasha, Cat, Matt, Combo.

508
00:30:23,701 --> 00:30:24,500
Halo, George.

509
00:30:24,596 --> 00:30:25,763
Dan halo juga, Steve.

510
00:30:28,066 --> 00:30:30,654
Itu peraturan kolam no. 2.
Kalau mau makan, ya makan.

511
00:30:31,883 --> 00:30:33,129
Peraturan kolam No. 3,

512
00:30:33,233 --> 00:30:34,926
