548
00:31:50,900 --> 00:31:51,860
Baiklah, kumohon.

549
00:31:51,966 --> 00:31:53,166
Aku butuh waktumu sebentar.

550
00:31:53,200 --> 00:31:55,120
Bisa kita bicara secara pribadi?

551
00:31:55,735 --> 00:31:56,421
Begitu, ya.

552
00:31:57,339 --> 00:31:58,248
Astaga.

553
