Di sana!

607
00:34:35,452 --> 00:34:36,052
Tidak!

608
00:34:36,271 --> 00:34:37,677
Tidak, tidak tidak!

609
00:34:37,702 --> 00:34:38,484
Mabel, tunggu!

610
00:34:38,633 --> 00:34:40,001
Telinga kecilmu nanti sakit!

611
00:34:40,833 --> 00:34:42,700
Kehilangan pendengaran itu selamanya!

612
