Ayo, dong.

674
00:39:42,243 --> 00:39:44,882
Mabel, jangan begitu.

675
00:39:46,168 --> 00:39:46,972
Iya, deh.

676
00:39:47,432 --> 00:39:48,672
Tapi aku tak bisa lama-lama.

677
00:39:53,666 --> 00:39:55,080
Tol Lingkar Beaverton.

678
00:39:55,186 --> 00:39:58,130
Membuatmu pergi ke mana pun
lebih cepat empat menit.

679
00:39:58,189 --> 00:39:59,547
Oh, iya. Besok ada kampanye.

680
