Cagar Alam</i>

1521
01:31:59,366 --> 01:32:00,566
<i>Berang-berang.</i>

1522
01:32:03,833 --> 01:32:06,015
<i>Potongan kayu.</i>

1523
01:32:06,040 --> 01:32:07,406
<i>Kelapa. Rumah sakit.</i>

1524
01:32:07,431 --> 01:32:09,168
<i>Pria berdansa. Kentang.</i>

1525
01:32:10,266 --> 01:32:12,194
<i>Hati.</i>

1526
01:32:13,752 --> 01:32:15,419
<i>Hati berputar.</i>

1527
01:32:17,266 --> 01:32:18,206
<i>Kentang.</i>

1528
01:32:26,366 --> 01:32:36,366
<i>Alih Bahasa: GubrakZ</i>

1529
01:35:06,940 --> 01:35:09,245
Lihat aku. Aku Raja Manusia.

1530
01:35:09,270 --> 01:35:11,974
Aku pria besar.
Aku bayar pajak.

1531
01:35:12,633 --> 01:35:13,602
Undang-undang.

1532
01:35:14,833 --> 01:35:16,019
Sosis.

1533
01:35:16,373 --> 01:35:18,120
Tol lingkar. Kendaraan.

1534
01:35:18,892 --> 01:35:20,983
Aku suka kemacetan!
Mobil besar.

1535
01:35:21,060 --> 01:35:22,981
Macet parah. Lebih parah lagi!

1536
